 "(a) Ordinary overlapping mates: pair_overlap, a 60 bp fragment chr1:41-100 read 40 + 40"

                  "41"      "51"      "61"      "71"      "81"      "91"     "100"
                   |         |         |         |         |         |        |
 "chr1"      ------+---------+---------+---------+---------+---------+--------+------------

 "input"
             "40M  POS 41  PNEXT 61  TLEN 60  MC 40M"
 "R1 +"            *-====================================->

             "40M  POS 61  PNEXT 41  TLEN -60  MC 40M"
 "R2 -"                                <-====================================-*

                                       ####################
             "chr1:61-80, 20 bases, L = 60"

 "output: equal scores, so R1 keeps the overlap and R2 gives up its 3' 20 bases"

             "40M  POS 41  PNEXT 81  TLEN 60  MC 20S20M   (Q30+Q30 -> Q40 over 61-80)"
 "R1 +"            *-====================================->

             "20S20M  POS 81  PNEXT 41  TLEN -60  MC 40M"
 "R2 -"                                <~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~==================-*


 *-====->  "a read, 5' end to 3' end: aligned (M)"
 *~~~~~~>  "soft clip (S)"
 *------>  "hard clip (H): not in SEQ"
 ########  "bases observed by both reads"
